 "titulo": "You wake up in 480 BC as one of the 300 ⚔️ Thermopylae Part 1 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "1 KING MUST DIE",
 "descripcion": "The oracle of Delphi gave Sparta two choices: the city falls, or a king dies. King Leonidas chose 300 men, all fathers with living sons, and marched to a narrow pass.\n\n> Part 2: {when_next}.\nWould you have marched?\n\nFrom Herodotus, Histories, book 7 (chapters 175-228). Herodotus gives millions of Persians; modern historians estimate roughly 100,000 to 300,000.\n#thermopylae #sparta #300 #ancienthistory #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "You wake up in 480 BC, and the largest army the world has ever seen is coming for you.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Xerxes, King of Persia, is marching on Greece.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Herodotus says millions. Historians today say maybe two hundred thousand.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Either way, more men than the whole of Sparta.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The oracle of *Delphi* gave Sparta a terrible answer.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Either your city burns, or a king of Sparta dies.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "King Leonidas made his choice.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the way he picked his men tells you everything.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He took *three hundred* Spartans, and every one had a living son.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So that no family line would end on the battlefield.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "They marched north to a pass called *Thermopylae*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Mountains on one side, the sea on the other.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In places, the road was barely wide enough for one cart.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Here, numbers didn't matter. Only shields.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A Persian rider came to spy on them.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He found the Spartans combing their long hair, and exercising.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Xerxes laughed when he heard it. He waited four days for them to run.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "They didn't. Part two, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
